1
00:00:00,082 --> 00:00:03,482
(Dan:)Wait, wait.
You're scared of Bernadette?

2
00:00:03,485 --> 00:00:05,085
(Penny:)Yeah, kind of.

3
00:00:05,087 --> 00:00:08,457
I thought it was just me!

4
00:00:10,492 --> 00:00:12,022
E-Everyone thinks she's so nice

5
00:00:12,027 --> 00:00:15,427
(Dan:)with that squeaky little voice.

6
00:00:15,431 --> 00:00:17,301
(Penny:)I know, but she's
kind of a bully!

7
00:00:17,299 --> 00:00:19,499
(stammers)
She is!

8
00:00:19,501 --> 00:00:21,001
I-I didn't even want
to meet you,

9
00:00:21,003 --> 00:00:24,473
(Dan:)but, uh, I was too scared
to say no to her.

10
00:00:24,473 --> 00:00:26,143
Me, too!

11
00:00:26,141 --> 00:00:27,941
Yeah, yeah!
One-one time, I had...

12
00:00:27,943 --> 00:00:29,513
Oh! (laughs)
I had to tell her

13
00:00:29,511 --> 00:00:31,081
(Dan:)we were cutting
the-the research funding

14
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,780
(Dan:)for one of the drugs
she was developing.

15
00:00:32,781 --> 00:00:34,011
(Penny:)What happened?

16
00:00:34,016 --> 00:00:35,646
I couldn't do it!

17
00:00:35,651 --> 00:00:37,681
She's still working on it!
(laughs)

18
00:00:37,686 --> 00:00:39,886
(laughing)

19
00:00:40,989 --> 00:00:42,189
Oh!

20
00:00:42,191 --> 00:00:44,091
(Dan:)We're not gonna tell her
about this, right?

21
00:00:44,093 --> 00:00:46,223
Oh, my God, no!
No, no...

22
00:00:47,529 --> 00:00:49,799
(Sheldon:)At the hot dog stand
in the Denver train station...

23
00:00:49,798 --> 00:00:51,468
(Sheldon:)Heinz ketchup.

24
00:00:51,467 --> 00:00:52,667
(Sheldon:)At the hot dog stand

25
00:00:52,668 --> 00:00:54,168
(Sheldon:)in the Salt Lake City
train station...

26
00:00:54,169 --> 00:00:55,639
(Sheldon:)Heinz ketchup.

27
00:00:55,637 --> 00:01:00,027
(Sheldon:)At the hot dog stand in the
Indianapolis train station...

